      "extract": "Quantum groups and braid groups as fundamental symmetries Niels G. Gresnigt∗† Xi’an Jiaotong-Liverpool University E-mail: niels.gresnigt@xjtlu.edu.cn The role of quantum groups and braid groups in the description of Standard Model particles is discussed. Some recent results on the use of the quantum groupSUq(3) as a ﬂavour symmetry are reviewed and a connection between two descriptions of Standard Model symmetries,",
      "extractCut": true,
